@startuml
[*] --> Created : User creates an account
Created --> Logged In : User logs in
Logged In --> Applied For Visa : User applies for visa after logging in, make the payment and then the application is accepted
Applied For Visa --> Viewed Status : System updates status and user views it
Viewed Status --> Cancelled Application : User cancels application after viewing status
Cancelled Application --> Approved : Document check result (approved)
Cancelled Application --> Rejected : Document check result (rejected)
Logged In --> Modified Details : User modifies details after logging in
Modified Details --> Given Feedback : User gives feedback after modifying details
Given Feedback --> Viewed Status : User checks the status after giving feedback
Viewed Status --> Cancelled Application : User cancels application after viewing status
Applied For Visa --> Rejected : Document check result (rejected)
Logged In --> Viewed Purpose : User views purpose of application after logging in
Viewed Purpose --> Applied For Visa : User applies for visa after viewing purpose
Modified Details --> Logout : User logs out after modifying details
Given Feedback --> Logout : User logs out after giving feedback
Viewed Status --> Logout : User logs out after viewing status
Cancelled Application --> Logout : User logs out after cancelling application
Approved --> Logout : User logs out after approval
Rejected --> Logout : User logs out after rejection
@enduml
